#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:11
#: d979d5fc78534b598799268e9d311a92
msgid ""
"The APM2.x is end of life for use with ArduPilot. This article is made "
"available for existing users."
msgstr "APM2.x 已停止与 ArduPilot 配合使用。本文仅供现有用户参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:14
#: a51f794c516e4863a4009ef4ae4ab795
msgid ""
"This article provides high level information about how to power APM2.x and "
"connect its most important peripherals."
msgstr "本文提供了关于如何为 APM2.x 供电并连接其最重要外设的高层信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:18
#: 7ec74c1da8b642c0b4d9a6047b4506a1
msgid "APM Wiring Diagram"
msgstr "APM 接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:20
#: 4e0b4a0eaa7f41d9b8c9292867e3922e
msgid ""
"The diagram below is an overview of how an APM2 can be connected to a "
"receiver, ESC, GPS and even a camera gimbal."
msgstr "下图概述了 APM2 如何连接接收机、ESC、GPS 乃至相机云台。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:27
#: f92eb4800eba48d4ba7164dab6a1b050
msgid "Powering the autopilot"
msgstr "为飞控供电"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:29
#: ef114d55b224467e98c5293185b5906c
msgid ""
"The easiest way to power the APM2.x is using a :ref:`3DR Power Module "
"<common-3dr-power-module>` with a LiPo battery."
msgstr ""
"为 APM2.x 供电最简便的方法是使用 :ref:`3DR 电源模块 <common-3dr-power-module>` 配合 LiPo 电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:32
#: 6790d07634a848eca2280e928256c1e8
msgid ""
"To wire a power module, connect the red-and-black two wire cable on the "
"power module to the PDB red and black two-wire. Connect the power module to "
"the APM PM port using a 6-position cable. Connect the PDB multi-wire cable "
"to APM Output Signal pins with the M1 wire connecting to the signal pin "
"labeled 1, M6 and signal pin 6, etc. See the above link for additional "
"detail."
msgstr ""
"连接电源模块时，将电源模块上的红黑两线电缆连接到 PDB 的红黑两线。使用 6 针电缆将电源模块连接到 APM PM 端口。将 PDB 多线电缆连接到 "
"APM 输出信号引脚，M1 线连接到标有 1 的信号引脚，M6 连接到信号引脚 6，依此类推。详情请参见上方链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:42
#: cdd4bc6f06b34be49bd78b6eb83e799e
msgid ""
"The Power Module will not power servos and other peripherals. For more "
"information/alternatives see :ref:`Powering the APM2 <common-powering-the-"
"apm2>`."
msgstr ""
"电源模块不会为舵机和其他外设供电。更多信息/替代方案请参阅 :ref:`为 APM2 供电 <common-powering-the-apm2>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:46
#: dcf9c6506a164468ab2f75e4a9829752
msgid "Connect ESCs and motors"
msgstr "连接 ESC 和电机"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:48
#: 10f4fc3b30a64c4db2232656093e43a7
msgid ""
":ref:`Connecting the ESCs and Motors <connect-escs-and-motors>` explains how"
" to set up the connections, and the motor configuration setup for each "
"frame."
msgstr ":ref:`连接 ESC 和电机 <connect-escs-and-motors>` 介绍了如何设置连接以及各机架类型的电机配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:52
#: 09a4115aa0e4485faf93c98a0525d5d1
msgid ""
"You will need to connect motor cables to electronic speed controller (ESC) "
"bullet connectors (each motor must connect to only one ESC)."
msgstr "您需要将电机电缆连接到电调（ESC）子弹头连接器（每个电机只能连接一个 ESC）。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-the-apm2.rst:58
#: ece4d1db37be4d9590278341f1315876
msgid ""
"Connect ESC Deans connectors to Power Distribution Board (PDB) Deans "
"connectors. Connect three-wire cables from the ESCs to the PDB signal pins "
"according to motor number (see link above to find the motor number "
"configuration for your frame). Connect the ESC for motor 1 to the PDB pins "
"marked M1, motor 6's ESC to the pins marked M6, etc."
msgstr ""
"将 ESC Deans 接头连接到电源分配板（PDB）的 Deans 接头。按电机编号将 ESC 三线电缆连接到 PDB "
"信号引脚（参见上方链接查找您机架的电机编号配置）。将电机 1 的 ESC 连接到标有 M1 的 PDB 引脚，电机 6 的 ESC 连接到标有 M6 "
"的引脚，依此类推。"
